{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TTe4jq6chr1795043264.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國原油庫存較預期增加更多，原油期貨價格下挫。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報83.26美元一桶，跌2.75美元，跌幅近百分之3.2。倫敦期油收市報91.95美元一桶，跌1.19美元，跌幅近百分之1.3。</p><p></p><p>美國能源信息署公布，截至本月13日一星期，美國商業原油庫存增加338萬桶，至接近4.18億桶，遠超市場預期增加5.8萬桶。成品油庫存同樣錄得較大升幅，當中汽油庫存增加519萬桶，至接近2.16億桶，多過市場預期的增幅160萬桶。蒸餾油庫存增加157萬桶，至接近1.05億桶，亦大過市場預期增加130萬桶。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:04:18.340193+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:29.447380+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:57:35.750477+00:00","content_hash":"8a49e5d1c76510c4008604cb929976ab73ee17e86c02f8c0948d128d37a7df0f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:04:18.340193+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}